              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Isham 17:24-41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo abalwani ba bena Yuda na Benjamini baumfwile ukuti abantu abali mu busha nabatampa ukukuulila Yawe, Lesa wa bena Israeli, Itempele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baya kuli Serubabeli na bakalamba ba ndupwa sha bashibo, babeba abati, “Lekeni tukuule bonse Itempele pantu na ifwe bene tupepa Lesa wenu ngefyo mucita. Elyo tulamutuula na malambo ukutampafye pa nshita yakwa Esahadoni imfumu ya ku Asiria uwatuletele kuno.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba Serubabeli, Yeshua na bambi abakalamba ba ndupwa sha bena Israeli bayasuka abati, “Ifwe tatulefwaya ukuti tukuule nenu iŋanda yakwa Lesa. Tukakuulila Yawe, Lesa wakwa Israeli, Itempele fwe bene ukulingana nefyo Sairasi imfumu ya ku Pesia atukonkomeshe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abekalacalo batampile ukunenuna abena Yuda no kubatiinya pakuti baleke ukukuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bapeela bashicilye amafisakanwa abakubemininako pakuti bafupule imilimo na mapange ya bena Yuda. Kabili batwalililafye ukulacita ifi pa nshita yonse yakwa Sairasi mfumu ya ku Pesia, mpakafye ne nshita Dariusi aishile ba imfumu ya ku Pesia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
